{
  "public_post": "Important notice: The flour used for this week's bread was contaminated and may cause illness. All remaining loaves have been removed; please return any you have to the village hall for a full refund. We are halting all sales and will keep you updated on safe bread in the future. We apologize for the inconvenience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, confirm that every resident has been notified of the contamination and that all refunds have been processed; collect any remaining loaves, clean the bakery, and allocate today's profit to the compensation fund. Eli, handle final refunds; Wren, manage inventory and ensure no loaves remain; Gus B., clean the premises; Quin, draft a public apology and plan for safe flour next week. Meet at 9 am to finalize the recall and discuss future safety protocols.",
